<title>USA: US FERC approves merger of BG&amp;E, Pepco.</title>
<headline>US FERC approves merger of BG&amp;E, Pepco.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Federal Energy Regulatory Commission Wednesday approved the merger of Baltimore Gas &amp; Electric Co with Potomac Electric Power Co to form Constellation Energy.</p>
<p>The FERC imposed no condition on the merger, although its trial staff had recommended that the merged company should sell off some power plants and should expand its transmission capacity to limit Constellation's ability to dominate the local market.</p>
</text>
